                            <font face="Arial" size="-1"><b>Question of the Week: What Race?</b></font><br>
                            <font face="Verdana" size="-2">Cynthe has posed a new Question of the Week over on the <a class=post href=http://boards.stratics.com/cgi-bin/forum/origin/postlist.pl?Cat=&Board=uo2ideas&page=0&view=collapsed&sb=5>Stratics QotW Forum</a> asking us what race we will be; hit the thread <a class=post href=http://boards.stratics.com/cgi-bin/forum/origin/showflat.pl?Cat=&Board=uo2ideas&Number=847207&page=0&view=collapsed&sb=5>here</a> and add your thoughts!</font><BR><BR>
                            	
                            <font face="Arial" size="-1"><b>Want Your Question In The Official FAQ?</b></font><br>
                            <font face="Verdana" size="-2">Do you want to get your question in the <a class=post href=http://www.uo2.com/faq.html>Official UWO:O FAQ</a>?  Then head over to our <a class=post href=http://vnboards.ign.com/board.asp?brd=5240>UWO:O FAQ Board</a> where the Origin Development Team will be selecting questions to be answered in the <a class=post href=http://www.uo2.com/faq.html>Official FAQ</a>.  What are you waiting for?  Get over there and ask away!</font><BR><BR>
                            	
                            <font face="Arial" size="-1"><b>Exclusive Screeshot from UO2 Vault</b></font><br>
                            <font face="Verdana" size="-2">This week's fansite exclusive comes from <a class=post href=http://origin.xrgaming.net>CoNB</a>; just <a class=post href=http://origin.xrgaming.net/index.php?image=screens/garron.jpg>click here</a> to view the screenshot.</font><BR><BR>
                            	
