                            <font face="Arial" size="-1"><b>Guidebook-Moongates and Magical Travel</b></font><br>
                            <font face="Verdana" size="-2">We've added a brand new section to our Guidebook entitled <a class=post href=http://uo2vault.ign.com/guidebook/moongates/>Moongates and Magical Travel</a>.  Do you know how the moongates will work in Origin?  What about personal travel spells?  <a class=post href=http://uo2vault.ign.com/guidebook/moongates/>Click here</a> to find out!</font><BR><BR>
                            	
