From Ubiq on the <a class=post href=http://boards.stratics.com/cgi-bin/forum/origin/postlist.pl?Cat=&Board=uo2devboard&page=1&view=expanded&sb=5>Stratics DevBoard</a>:
<!-- End From -->
<!-- Begin Story -->
<!-- Indent --><table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0"><tr><td width="15"><img src="/images/blank.gif" width=15 height=1 border=0 alt=""></td><td><font face="Arial" size="-1" color="#000068"><!-- End Indent-->
We have 3 different composers composing music for the game - each one chosen to best represent the feel for the continent they are providing music for. We also have some technology in place that hopefully will mix up the music on the fly and try to keep it from getting too repetitive, but frankly, some of you guys will play this game for hundreds or even thousands of hours. Even the Beatles get tiresome if you listen to them that long. =)
